@startuml 02-sequencia-submissao-triagem
title Fluxo de Submissão e Triagem por IA de um Certificado

actor Aluno
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as FE
participant "API\n(/api/student/uploads)" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Redis (BullMQ)" as Queue
participant "Worker Python" as Worker
participant "Google Drive" as Drive
participant "Gemini API" as Gemini
actor Admin

Aluno -> FE : Envia certificado (arquivo + dados)
FE -> API : POST /uploads
API -> Drive : Upload do arquivo
Drive --> API : fileId, fileUrl
API -> DB : Cria Certificate\n(status=PENDING, aiStatus=QUEUED)
API -> Queue : Enfileira job (certificate_id)
API --> FE : 201 Created
FE --> Aluno : Confirmação de envio

Queue -> Worker : Job disponível
Worker -> DB : set aiStatus=PROCESSING
Worker -> Drive : download_file(fileId)
Drive --> Worker : bytes do arquivo
Worker -> Gemini : analyze_certificate_file()
Gemini --> Worker : valid, category, title,\nhours, reasons
Worker -> DB : update aiStatus=COMPLETED,\naiDecision, aiSuggestedTitle,\naiSuggestedHours, aiFeedback

Admin -> FE : Acessa painel de revisão
FE -> API : GET /admin/uploads
API -> DB : Busca certificados + sugestão da IA
DB --> API : Lista de certificados
API --> FE : Dados para revisão
Admin -> FE : Aprova/Rejeita (decisão final)
FE -> API : PATCH /admin/uploads/:id
API -> DB : Atualiza status final\n+ feedback humano
API --> FE : Confirmação
FE --> Aluno : Notificação de status atualizado

@enduml
